    {
      "id": "pb-1793775600000-3",
      "kind": "format",
      "text": "Never open a LinkedIn post with the \"X often fails\" / \"is often the difference\" / \"often leads to\" formula. Open with a specific fact, a clear stance or a concrete situation.",
